WEBVTT

00:05:00.132 --> 00:05:03.005
As we're looking out,
kind of a surreal moment

00:05:03.029 --> 00:05:04.333
before the first stroke,

00:05:04.357 --> 00:05:06.859
standing on the rocks at Marina Hemingway,

00:05:06.883 --> 00:05:09.552
the Cuban flag is flying above,

00:05:09.576 --> 00:05:13.826
all my team is out in their boats,
hands up in the air,

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:15.168
"We're here!

00:05:15.914 --> 00:05:17.093
We're here for you!"

00:05:19.017 --> 00:05:21.106
Bonnie and I look at each other and say,

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:24.379
this year, the mantra is --
and I've been using it in training --

00:05:25.216 --> 00:05:26.372
Find a way.

00:05:27.137 --> 00:05:28.338
You have a dream

00:05:29.871 --> 00:05:32.862
and you have obstacles
in front of you, as we all do.